WEBVTT

00:00:00.035 --> 00:00:03.796
If a required field is missing, a visitor can see "Enter a

00:00:03.855 --> 00:00:06.966
way for us to contact you." If the storage service is

00:00:07.036 --> 00:00:10.344
down, the owner may need an operational log naming the

00:00:10.391 --> 00:00:13.177
failing component and a safe troubleshooting action.

00:00:13.874 --> 00:00:17.032
Logs should avoid recording sensitive contact details,

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:20.840
credentials, or raw external payloads unnecessarily.

00:00:21.281 --> 00:00:24.404
The point is not to make every error public; it is to

00:00:24.497 --> 00:00:27.388
ensure the right person can understand and respond to the

00:00:27.434 --> 00:00:27.899
failure.
